Droid Sans Fallback subset
Copyright 2006–2010 Google Corp. Droid is a trademark of Google Corp.

This file is a subset of Droid Sans Fallback. The IDE loads system fonts first.
This face only supplies glyphs the UI font and the system fonts lack, so Japanese
and Simplified Chinese still draw when the machine has no CJK font. It covers the
characters in every ja and zh-CN Fluent file, plus the language names and common
CJK punctuation. A file name outside this set still needs a system font.

The full face is about 3.9 MB. This subset is 175984 bytes (about 172 KB),
generated with fontTools (`tools/fonts/subset_cjk.py`).

